WEBVTT

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:06.560
No! No way!

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.070
It's still cold outside!

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:11.950
Why do you guys want to 
go out there so badly?!

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:15.310
I can't cast explosion 
magic unless I'm outside!

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.840
Monsters start to become 
active as spring approaches,

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.450
so that means work for adventurers!

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.300
Are you guys children?!

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.440
Are you two basically little kids 
who want to go play outside?!

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.640
If you want to go outside 
so bad, go without me!

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.460
Who are you calling a little kid?!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.090
You're acting far more 
childish right now, Aqua!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.470
At this rate...

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.470
You'll end up like <i>that</i>.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.140
Okay, even I would rather 
not end up like that...

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:44.640
But why don't you convince 
that loser before me?!

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:48.300
Listen, you three. Even-tempered as 
I may be, I still get angry sometimes.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.260
Where do you get off calling 
someone "that" and a loser?

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.610
How rude can you be?

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.110
If you have a problem, why don't 
you get out from under there first?

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:15.700
<b>KONOSUBA!
God's Blessing on this Wonderful World! 2</b>

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:35.500
<b>Episode 6  Goodbye to This Irritating Living World!</b>

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:38.050
<i>We defeated the demon Vanir, 
one of the Devil King's commanders...</i>

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:42.010
<i>But we weren't able to 
savor our victory for long.</i>

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:45.480
<i>Wiz is also one of the 
Devil King's commanders.</i>

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:48.380
<i>The fact that we had 
slain one of her comrades</i>

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.020
<i>was something that we had to tell her.</i>

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:54.060
I'll tell her about Vanir.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:57.530
It wasn't for long, but we shared a 
body and wreaked havoc together.

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:01.340
As a crusader in the service of Eris-sama,

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:03.610
I probably shouldn't say such a thing...

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:07.780
But I didn't dislike him.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.880
Wiz, we need to tell you something...

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:19.610
Hey, welcome, folks!

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:21.600
Now, girl who had a distant look in her eyes

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.900
as she was in front of the store 
spouting embarrassing nonsense...

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.150
There's something I must inform you of.

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:28.690
"But I didn't dislike him!"

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.950
About that... You see, 
we demons have no gender,

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:35.420
so that embarrassing declaration of 
your feelings is nothing I can—oh, my!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:39.150
Now this is an intense swell 
of dark emotions! Most savory!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.880
What's the matter? You've curled up 
and hidden your face in your knees.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.930
Did you actually think that I had perished?!

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:46.160
There, there...

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.610
I heard all about it, Kazuma-san.

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:51.830
Defeating Vanir-san has cleared up 
those spying charges of yours.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.170
Congratulations!

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:54.770
That's great and all,

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:57.450
but why is he totally fine after 
taking a blast of explosion magic?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.840
Why isn't he hurt at all?!

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.470
When hit with such sorcery,

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.660
even one such as I couldn't escape unscathed.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.430
Take a good look at my mask!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:10.680
I lost one of my extra lives, 
making me Vanir II!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.430
Quit messing around!

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:16.880
Vanir-san actually wanted to leave his post 
as one of the Devil King's commanders.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:20.940
So, currently, he doesn't maintain the 
barrier around the Devil King's castle.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.740
He should be harmless as a result.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:25.360
Y-You think he's harmless?

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.250
You, boy from a distant land...

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.120
I believe you would be well served 
in assisting in our business.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:36.100
I've got an excellent offer. Care to hear it?

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.340
<i>Vanir's big moneymaking scheme</i>

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:43.840
<i>was making stuff from my world 
and selling it in this one.</i>

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.280
<i>I just have to make and develop the products.</i>

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:49.750
<i>The manufacturing and distribution 
are Vanir's to handle.</i>

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:53.180
<i>And the first idea for this plan was 
the kotatsu I am currently under.</i>

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:58.370
We're all very impressed with the 
furniture from your homeland, Kazuma.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:00.830
But shouldn't we be getting back to work?

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:02.030
She's right, Kazuma.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:03.820
Come on.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.110
Freeze!

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.160
Eek!

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:13.710
H-He actually fought back!

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.000
Kazuma, would you please give it a rest?!

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.880
Stop making such a fuss and—

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.820
Ow! My head...

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.100
Don't underestimate me.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:28.890
I'm the Kazuma-san who's tangled with the 
Devil King's commanders and other big shots.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.100
Try again after you've leveled up a bit!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:37.040
Do you think your petty 
tricks will really— Eek!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:40.250
The theft of my magic power is a 
crime deserving of a thousand—

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.110
So... tired...

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:48.570
I get the feeling I could 
take anyone on right now!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.460
Wait. We've got an emergency.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.580
I realize this might be asking a bit 
much, but let's call a ceasefire.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.540
Sorry, but could you two lift 
the mat under the kotatsu

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.380
and carry me to the bathroom, please?

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.010
That was easier than I thought.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.250
Let's dump him and his kotatsu outside.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:12.010
Good idea. Aqua, open the window, would you?

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.600
Stop it! Do you people have no hearts?!

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.680
H-Hey, cut it out! Wait, no—

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:18.190
Heave-ho!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.360
Ugh, it's still so cold...

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.240
Fireplace... Sofa...

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.870
Kazuma, why are we taking this street?

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.710
This isn't the way to the guild.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.370
Did you think I was just roasting 
under the kotatsu all this time?

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:42.130
Hey!

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:43.590
Welcome!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.310
Is it ready, Pops?

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:47.090
Is my katana ready to go?!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.620
Yeah. I managed to finish it.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:52.090
I did make it in the shape you described...

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:53.610
Here you go.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:02.450
I didn't really get the hardening 
techniques you were going on about,

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:04.610
but it was an interesting job anyway!

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.180
O-ho...

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:10.360
So that's your new partner, huh?

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:13.510
My new partner.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.650
When did you order a sword like that, Kazuma?

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:20.350
I learned a smithing skill 
from this guy a while back.

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:24.290
You mentioned needing that for 
your new financial venture, right?

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:25.740
And while I was at it,

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:29.600
I made the order, figuring I 
was due for a gear upgrade.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:34.940
You just need to write a name for it on 
this talisman, and attach it to the handle.

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:37.600
Make sure it's a good one!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.600
And then...

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:42.550
Here's your full-plate armor.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:47.020
This is fancier than what most of the 
adventurers around these parts have.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:48.400
Take good care of it.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.400
This is it! This is real 
gear for a fantasy setting!

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:57.660
I might've just witnessed 
the birth of a new hero...

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.540
KONOSUBA!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.010
I guess clothes really do make the man.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:11.050
Even most crusaders can't 
equip this kind of armor!

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.930
Kazuma, do a pose with your sword!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.190
Kazuma?

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:28.070
First-rate warriors don't demonstrate 
their techniques for show...

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:30.320
Too heavy to move in, huh?

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:32.570
Could someone undo 
the latches on the back?

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.450
Well, better to use the gear 
you're most familiar with, right?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:40.870
I guess I'll just have to 
settle for a new weapon...

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:51.380
I'm counting on you, partner!

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.270
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.650
Uh, w-well, thanks again.

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:32.090
This is nothing like I imagined!

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:42.390
Your partner seems a lot shorter now.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.790
Shut up!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.770
I want to at least make 
sure it has a cool name...

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:50.220
Muramasa?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.550
Masamune? Kotetsu?

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:54.990
Kazuma! Megumin!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:55.610
Hey!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:57.490
There's a great quest here!

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:01.370
These monsters are called Lizard Runners.

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:05.990
When entering their mating period, the 
males gather around the Princess Runner,

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:07.760
forming a massive group,

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:11.270
and then they compete for the 
Princess Runner's affections.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:12.700
Compete?

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.000
They run!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:19.640
In a huge group, trampling 
anything that gets in their path.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:22.320
The fastest male becomes the King Runner,

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.370
and the Princess Runner's mate.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.560
That sounds like a real handful...

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:30.210
This quest involves getting 
rid of the Lizard Runners.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:33.310
There are many of them, 
so it may be dangerous...

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.260
It's okay.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:40.060
No matter what monster it is, 
it's no match for this guy and me.

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:43.200
Isn't that right, my partner... uh...

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.540
Kikuichimonji? Kogarasumaru?

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.790
Chunchunmaru.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:48.720
Say what, now?

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:50.540
I said Chunchunmaru.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.790
This sword's name is Chunchunmaru.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:55.500
There's no way I can give 
it such a goofy name!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:59.560
As my preferred blade, 
it needs a suitably cool name...

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.220
From now on, this sword 
is named Chunchunmaru.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:09.100
What the hell did you just do?!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.600
Listen...

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:15.830
Even if I do I defeat the 
Devil King with this sword,

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.500
"The legendary hero's sword, Chunchunmaru"

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:22.610
is what it's gonna say on 
the plaque in the museum.

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:26.370
I gave it such a cool name 
for you. What's your problem?

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:32.120
<b>Eliminate the group of Lizard Runners</b>

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:32.120
<b>Kill Quest</b>

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.960
Everybody ready?

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.720
I'm ready to go anytime!

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:42.990
Thanks to Aqua's support magic,

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.720
I can endure as many of them as needed!

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:48.230
And if any get through, just leave them to me.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.850
I'll blow them all to smithereens.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:53.350
All right, stick to the plan!

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:56.810
First, I'll Snipe the King 
and Princess Runners...

00:11:58.190 --> 00:11:59.610
With those two down,

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:02.340
the rest of the Lizard 
Runners should disperse,

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.110
meaning we can ignore the rest.

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:07.760
If my Snipe fails, and they head this way,

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:12.900
Darkness will hold them up so that I can 
Snipe the King and Princess Runners.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.630
And if any manage to get past her,

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:20.420
Megumin will blow them all away 
before they can surround us,

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:23.200
and I can pick off any 
survivors from up here.

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.220
Aqua, focus on backing us up!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.840
All right, here we go!

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:40.150
I can tell that's the Princess, but...

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:43.190
Hey, Aqua! Which one's the King?

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.740
Probably the most high-and-mighty-looking one?

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:48.200
I was a fool for even asking you.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:51.890
I know! The King is the fastest one, right?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.040
Oh?

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:52.440
Uh-huh.

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:54.110
I can use magic to get their attention,

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:56.960
and the first one to get here is the King!

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:56.960
Wha?!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:58.590
Hey, what are you sayi—

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:00.710
Force Fire!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.030
No! You freaking idiot!

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:16.060
Are you not satisfied unless you 
screw up every single time?!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.860
We could've neutralized them by just 
taking out the King and Princess,

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.730
so why call the whole group here?!

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.490
What's your problem?!

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:26.370
I was just trying to help! Don't yell at me!

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:29.450
And if I have to make up for it later, 
it'll just be the same as always!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:33.600
I'm going to get messed up by 
those Runners and be left crying!

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:36.470
I get it, okay?! It happens every time!

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:39.050
Go on, if you wanna kill me, just do it—

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.170
Don't lie down there!

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:49.370
They'll actually trample you to death!

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:53.220
Got him!

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.170
Hey! I beat the one that 
looked like the King,

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:04.070
but now they're even more violent!

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:05.950
The lizards get excited when a King

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:10.550
is defeated, because it means they have 
a chance to become the new King.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:13.400
You need to take down the 
Princess Runner first.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.830
You could've said that sooner!

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:16.790
Leave it to me!

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:18.250
Megumin!

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.880
Taste the power of my explosion magic!

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:24.880
Explosion!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:28.090
My magic power!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:31.780
Kazuma! I don't have enough magic 
power to activate my explosion magic!

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:29.550
Yes?!

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.280
Huh?! Why wouldn't you...

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:34.890
Wait...

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.520
It's my fault?!

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:40.900
Come at me!

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:42.400
Darkness!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.780
Kazuma-san! Kazuma-san—

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:53.290
Darkness, just hang in there! 
I'll take her down now!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:55.450
D-Don't worry about me!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.420
T-Take your time!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.230
Snipe!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.490
That was a close one...

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:51.210
K-Kazuma?! Are you all right?!

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:54.190
Aqua! Kazuma took a scary-looking fall!

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:55.630
Healing magic...

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:05.680
Try to live a bit more carefully, okay?

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:09.990
It wasn't easy to find a work-around 
to let you come back to life last time.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:12.660
I'm sorry. I have no excuse 
for what happened this time.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:17.830
You've taken a job as an adventurer,

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.260
so I know that danger is 
part of the lifestyle...

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.120
But you were a little too careless this time.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:25.750
Um, were the others okay after I died?

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:27.130
Yes.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.430
Senpai was lying down when it happened,

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:33.510
so she was trampled and kicked by 
the lizards, and started crying...

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.520
But as Darkness was holding them back,

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:39.380
with the Princess Runner slain, 
the rest of the group dispersed.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:42.990
Megumin-san is fine, 
thanks to Darkness's protection.

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:46.270
Right now, Senpai is repairing your body.

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:48.300
What a relief!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:52.280
In that case, is it okay if I 
wait here with you for a bit?

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:55.910
That's fine, but... you seem awfully calm.

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:59.910
Well, I've been through 
this a few times already.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.170
Don't you get bored in this big, empty room?

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.760
If I'm bored,

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:18.800
then that means everyone is safe and well.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:21.180
So having nothing to do is ideal for me.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.720
<i>What is this? Oh, man. My chest hurts...</i>

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:26.480
<i>That's it!</i>

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:30.860
<i>This is what my life in a 
parallel world was lacking!</i>

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.420
<i>They're all good-looking enough,</i>

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.260
<i>as far as looks go, anyway...</i>

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:41.700
<i>But I'm not after sex appeal.</i>

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.710
<i>I want a kind, sensible girl!</i>

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:48.210
<i>Yes! This is where my 
main heroine was hidden!</i>

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:53.010
To be honest, I'm not here all the time.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.840
Every now and then, I sneak off 
to the surface to have some fun.

00:17:56.740 --> 00:18:00.430
That's a secret between us, okay?

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.670
<i>Kazuma! Kazuma, can you hear me?</i>

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:09.140
<i>I cast Resurrection, 
so you can come back now.</i>

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:11.070
<i>Have Eris open the gate!</i>

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:14.840
I'll be back a little later!

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:17.390
I want to talk with Eris-sama a bit!

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:20.000
Just keep my body safe!

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:25.390
<i>What?! Quit being stupid and 
get your butt back here!</i>

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:29.460
<i>Hurry and level up so you can beat the Devil 
King and get me back to the heavenly realm!</i>

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:32.290
<i>The Devil King, huh?</i>

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:35.200
<i>If I come back to life, 
will I really be able to accomplish</i>

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.250
<i>something as ridiculous as defeating 
the Devil King with those three?</i>

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.300
<i>Hey, Kazuma! Can you hear me?</i>

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:42.300
<i>Let's say I do work hard. Will I 
develop some strange new power</i>

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:44.120
<i>that conveniently lets 
me beat the Devil King?</i>

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:44.450
<i>Eris, what did you say to him?</i>

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.560
<i>I'm pretty sure this harsh world 
won't make it that easy.</i>

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.890
<i>Kazuma, don't worry about what the 
goddess of padded chests has to say!</i>

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:50.250
<i>I'm probably going to die many more times.</i>

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:51.580
<i>There's no way of telling 
what else she's lying about!</i>

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:53.060
<i>And what do I even stand 
to gain for my efforts?</i>

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:55.630
<i>She's probably as phony about other stuff 
as she is her boobs, so be careful!</i>

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:58.800
<i>If you want, I can tell you 
even crazier things about her!</i>

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:57.850
Um, Kazuma-san—

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.700
<i>The padded goddess down there actually—</i>

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.370
Hey, Aqua!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:07.570
I'm sick of life, so I'm gonna be 
reborn and start over as a baby.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.730
Give the others my regards!

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.710
<i>What are you even talking about?!
Wait just a minute!</i>

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:18.340
Well, that being the case, 
if you could help me out here...

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:20.780
I don't want to be too selfish,

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.880
but I'd like to be born as a man again.

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:27.260
Also, I'd like a family with a pretty older 
stepsister and a cute younger stepsister!

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:29.980
W-W-Wait a second!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:35.230
<i>Kazuma, Darkness says she's gonna doodle 
on your face if you don't come back soon!</i>

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:38.190
<i>She's got a pen in her hand 
and looks really excited!</i>

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:41.290
<i>Th-That's not enough to 
make me change my mind.</i>

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.700
<i>I'm already dead! Do whatever you want.</i>

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:47.690
<i>Megumin, what are you doing? What are 
you doing with Kazuma's clothes?</i>

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:49.340
<i>Huh? Megumin? Wait... Megumin?!</i>

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:52.950
Hey! Cut it out! 
What are you doing to my body?!

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:55.630
You shouldn't mess around with 
dead bodies! It's bad karma!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.580
<i>Megumin! Megumin?!</i>

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:00.540
<i>Kazuma-san! Come back! Come back, now!</i>

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.710
Hey, cut it out!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:03.710
Aqua, stop Megumin! Stop—

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:07.010
Eris-sama, please, open the gate!

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:15.710
Well, Kazuma-san...

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:18.860
I'll be praying you don't 
find your way back here.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:21.240
Eris-sama... I...

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.240
Have a safe trip.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:27.310
I don't mind if they're padded!

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:36.660
Hey. What're you doing?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.830
Apart from your explosion 
obsession and goofy name,

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:42.430
I figured you had more common 
sense than the other two.

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:44.510
What the hell did you do to me?

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:48.570
If you have some problem with 
my name, then let's hear it.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:52.140
I did it because you made that 
dumb joke about not coming back.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.520
The next time you try 
something that foolish,

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.270
it's gonna be even worse, you hear?

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:09.300
You'd better not expect a sacred goddess 
like me to explain what she did.

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:11.910
Seriously, what did she do to me?

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:23.010
Kinda feels like...

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:34.010
Megumin! Where the hell is Megumin?!

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:38.030
She said she'd be staying at 
Yunyun's place for a few days—

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:38.960
Pipe down!

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.060
Y'know, Kazuma...

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:40.710
What?!

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:42.350
Self-esteem is a good thing,

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:44.570
but I have to question this 
kind of self-flattery.

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:46.200
S-Stupid!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:50.040
You were there when 
Megumin wrote this on me!

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.330
Damn it all!

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:57.910
What exactly are you calling 
the holy sword Excalibur?!

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:41.180
<b>To Funifura-san and Dodonko-san in the Crimson Demon Village.
How are you doing? I'm doing well. Right now, I'm an adventurer with some friends
in the town of Axel. Our members consist of an adventurer who is just starting out,
an arch priest girl, and a crusader girl. It's true. Also, Megumin has no friends.
I'd hate to end up like that. -Yunyun</b>

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:41.220
<b>Episode 7</b>

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:41.220
<b>An Invitation for This Knucklehead!</b>

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:34.770
To Funifura-san and Dodonko-san 
in the Crimson Demon Village.

00:23:34.770 --> 00:23:37.570
How are you doing? I'm doing well.

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:41.180
Right now, I'm an adventurer with 
some friends in the town of—
